      "transcript": [
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🩹 Antonia is still hurting (60 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "🎙️ The Eulogy's turn"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then they stood their ground, poor brave fools.\" The spotlight widens. (No weight yet — just the story starting.) (5 verses remain. Contradict it — do the opposite — or give it a better ending.)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "ROUND 2!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "The red comes down. Your next 3 strikes deal +100% damage. (Unleash Rage — hold on.)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "You focus — that costs your action."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🌀 Berserker Rage is STRAINING at its edges. The gift wants to become something — and it wants YOU to choose what."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "\"IT’S MOLTING! We didn’t program molting! This is YOUR doing! CHOOSE! Choose what it becomes!\""
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "\"We didn't even explain that part! You figured it out yourself! That's the good stuff! The gamblers are thrilled!\""
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "(−60 kcal — food becomes rage.)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "🎙️ The Eulogy's turn"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then they ran, and the spotlight followed.\" The spotlight narrows. Your dodge feels watched. (-10% dodge.) (4 verses remain. Contradict it — do the opposite — or give it a better ending.)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "💥 eulogy's attack finds you — no dodging it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "Armor absorbs 17."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "Eulogy's attack hits you for 28."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 Codex: Epitaph — locks onto one target — moving won't dodge it. You won't forget this."
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "ROUND 3!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "The red comes down. Your next 3 strikes deal +100% damage. (Unleash Rage — hold on.)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "You focus — that costs your action."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "(−60 kcal — food becomes rage.)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "🎙️ The Eulogy's turn"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then they bled, politely, where everyone could see.\" The narration lingers on your wounds. (Bleeds last 1 round longer.) (3 verses remain. Contradict it — do the opposite — or give it a better ending.)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "💥 It connects!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "Armor absorbs 25."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "Eulogy's attack hits you for 43."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 Codex: Final Chapter — strikes one target after a windup. You won't forget this."
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "ROUND 4!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "🎙️ The Eulogy's turn"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then they knelt, and the story approved.\" The story leans in. (The Eulogy's attacks +15.) (2 verses remain. Contradict it — do the opposite — or give it a better ending.)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "💥 Final Chapter!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "Armor absorbs 22."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "Eulogy's Final Chapter hits you for 38."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "You go down."
        },
        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "OH. Oh no. ...The gamblers are very quiet."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Afnan Bajunaid is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🕯️ Afnan Bajunaid is dead — the wild. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "What Afnan kept close goes into the ground with them — keepsakes are buried, never taken from the body."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "\"Afnan's gone.\" Kennedy looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Afnan.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Guiying blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! Whole new set of tricks. We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\""
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 The Codex turns a page: Afnan Bajunaid, 92 days. The mantle passes to Guiying Situ."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🪞 You wake up somebody else. Guiying Situ, 38 — a Vintner. Her hands know different work now: Iron Stomach, Green Whisper."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "You knew Afnan — not the office, the person. The fire keeps expecting her, and so do you. That's a heavier kind of stepping up. (+5 trauma)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "At the grave, Kennedy speaks for Guiying — \"Afnan trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "The fire knew Guiying before the Codex did — her name already carried weight here."
        }
      ],
